 * vilniusToUtc returns the correct UTC instant for wall-clock times across
 * winter / summer / DST-boundary days, and that subtractRanges produces the
 * expected sub-ranges. No DB calls — we test the pure helpers only.
 *
 * Run with:  pnpm --filter @workspace/scripts exec tsx ./src/test-coach-availability.ts
 */

